<title>The Philippines: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/philippines/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-philippines-2026-10-22T01:40:26.440Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 22 Oct 2026 01:40:26 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;China’s coast guard and navy continue to monitor Philippine supply missions to a grounded vessel at Ren\'ai Jiao and are shadowing a U.S. warship near a disputed shoal, prompting the Philippines to summon China’s ambassador over threatening remarks. Vice Admiral Rommel Supangan led the Philippine Coast Guard in rescuing four people, including a child, on Hagonoy Island, Surigao del Sur. Taiwan’s coast guard and maritime forces repelled sixteen mainland Chinese ships near the Pratas Islands. The United States and the Philippines held their sixteenth bilateral maritime exercise in the West Philippine Sea. 176 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxQX2gxa050Umh1ek1rbWMtb2xSNXRhSE9kbFBGeTZZUWhjVlFZakMwV0pMQTNpZjdHT1NJRXVvdUJCQkNVLXVMSnNvTm1XMHhaaW00Y1RTYk9FdWZENHo4VzlXc2FKTkdPM0lGYlRMTXNfdmxpSWctRlpMTFMxcjZIUlZ0VGtFMVJOcHZHeFhGTXkxZnB5VzQ0R1lvaw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Inquirer.net&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwgFBVV95cUxQLUFveU9melc1Ukl5RUJYQ3NQbm03aGpGMUJZbHYzQ09PaUowWUlQS1RBY25EYUpnZkhQMUlHbUFpMEh5SV9YNDN0cnlaLVd2U1h1a1VESmNTenh5UW00WkprU05MZ2phVF9DbTFDNHVhS1FkTWU3WGR3c0RvOXpnR1NkTlk4bTVFZVlacU5MMktkTFF0Qi1hRGF6V1dFYW1kNy1OR202Y2l4UjJ1QVZDNmRQM3ByLW9DcUpiVDA1REs1Zw?oc=5&quot;&gt;U.S. News &amp;amp; World Report&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;South China Morning Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihwFBVV95cUxPRTYtQ1lMT1AtYkxQdFhoRjlLeHgtTkptaWlLZnhlcUdSNVhmVFVDeE1CejVWUEpoT245ZU5iUnQ1bE1JT015bmwxdF83THNpclZUTUwyRUJpbVF3UWlxa1J2SDNBWm5xZXk3YmNBeUo1S2NrMEFVWE41bkJDUDNzazRPUHJoc0U?oc=5&quot;&gt;Yahoo News Singapore&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMifkFVX3lxTE1GUTVNLTVna2RkQ184a29MREJpYUgyTFA4eHYzd2xU